Subject: [PATCH] Test indexed development initialization and header-only
 admission

Integration review note (2026-10-15; original source commit had no body):
Add indexed initialization and header-admission regressions, including schema
refusal, active-index preservation, historical header stages and malformed
header rejection. This test-only change does not implement fork activation.

